 Project Priority Sparks Conflict Over Indigenous Newar Lands in Khokana</span> <div class=\"field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-8 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"> <div class=\"field__label\">Country</div> <div class=\"field__items \"> <div class=\"field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.culturalsurvival.org/country/nepal\" hreflang=\"en\">Nepal</a></div> </div> </div> <span><span>agnes</span></span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-07-13T19:41:11-04:00\" title=\"Monday, July 13, 2026 - 19:41\">Mon, 07/13/2026 - 19:41</time> </span> <div class=\"field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-14 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"> <div class=\"field__...","[2] As climate and conflict collide, Indigenous leaders confront overlapping crises at the UN (ictnews.org, Thu, 16 Jul 2026 15:34:13 +0000) - This story was originally published by Grist. Te Aniwaniwa Paterson & Dionne Phillips Grist This story is published through the Indigenous News Alliance. Although itâ€™s been nearly 20 years since more than 100 countries adopted the United Nations Declaration on the Rights of Indigenous Peoples, the rights and lives of those it is meant to protect remain under constant threat from compounding crises. Indigenous lands are battered by&nbsp; record-breaking storms , dessicated by drought, and vanishing under rising seas. Amid these climate-driven threats, Indigenous peoples continue dying by the hundreds in wars and&nbsp; while defending their lands , even as they are&nbsp; persecuted by gover...","[3] Meet Our 2026 Cohort of Indigenous Youth Fellows from Africa and Asia (culturalsurvival.org, Wed, 15 Jul 2026 14:01:08 +0000) - <span>Meet Our 2026 Cohort of Indigenous Youth Fellows from Africa and Asia</span> <div class=\"field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-8 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"> <div class=\"field__label\">Country</div> <div class=\"field__items \"> <div class=\"field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.culturalsurvival.org/country/global\" hreflang=\"en\">Global</a></div> </div> </div> <span><span>jamie</span></span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-07-15T10:01:08-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, July 15, 2026 - 10:01\">Wed, 07/15/2026 - 10:01</time> </span> <div class=\"field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-14 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"> <div class=\"field__label\">Issues</div> <div class=\"f...","[4] Bridging Tradition and Technology: The 1st Meeting of Indigenous Youth Communicators of Bahia (culturalsurvival.org, Fri, 17 Jul 2026 22:43:51 +0000) - <span>Bridging Tradition and Technology: The 1st Meeting of Indigenous Youth Communicators of Bahia</span> <div class=\"field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-8 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"> <div class=\"field__label\">Country</div> <div class=\"field__items \"> <div class=\"field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.culturalsurvival.org/country/brazil\" hreflang=\"en\">Brazil</a></div> </div> </div> <span><span>agnes</span></span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-07-17T18:43:51-04:00\" title=\"Friday, July 17, 2026 - 18:43\">Fri, 07/17/2026 - 18:43</time> </span> <div class=\"field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-14 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"> <div class=\"field__label\">Issue..."],"accountableAttention":{"rule":"make-the-click-preserve-the-warrant","headlineMustPreserve":["attribution","modality","scope","uncertainty","correction state"],"forbiddenStrengthenings":["source claim to newsroom fact","may/could/alleged to does/did/proves","single case to trend","correlation to causation","reader demand to evidence"],"correctionSurfacePolicy":"Any later correction to a cited claim must be propagated to body copy, headline, social cards, feeds, JSON-LD, and syndicated packets."},"constraints":["This packet is research intake, not a publishable article.","sourceUrls are source material; candidateReferences are the CSL-shaped cited cut available to writing.","claims remain attributed and source-bound until a manuscript's editing and publishing gates settle them.","Attention surfaces may increase curiosity, but must not create factual commitments absent from the packet or manuscript references.","Publication still requires body citations, editing standards review, and an explicit publishing action."]}}]

